WEBVTT

00:06:28.663 --> 00:06:33.371
It was a simple act, but nothing
short of a revolution for me.

00:06:34.246 --> 00:06:41.163
It was the revolution that started in this
blank notebook 30 years ago that

00:06:41.163 --> 00:06:44.163
shaped my life's work, the secret,

00:06:44.163 --> 00:06:48.996
silent correspondence with
myself like a gymnast.

00:06:48.996 --> 00:06:54.121
I started to move beyond the rigidity
of denial into what

00:06:54.121 --> 00:06:57.204
I have now come to call emotional agility.